  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - Tuā Kha-pôo Kang-bóo 大跤pôo江某"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">Tuā Kha-pôo Kang-bóo</h1>\n    \n    <h2 style=\"color: #444444; font-size: 22px; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 0px; text-align: center;\">大跤pôo江某</h2>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 陳意榕</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiLwv66f4B0ZvVpuDMWpg1nNbMdIkKvdSTHLQU4ge4C8zoG1oiWPz98X_tciI9FSUeiwMWiG6qLG7AG9O9fe5tQWUC_q2lzv4MYMM6dWp8B_71T0nS9QQl-w3Wdk-pvkVdb2CxmWiILSS8CZQTAu9JUZFzV-dHCcIQOIbOZufZYBKKN2iZVWJWF1_9uaMrU\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEivhlTv246UvA1k1OwtukmKvDVu_uI517FlyDk3KpL3g1hg8fRFspMr6nzyTYBaaGOeEpQdzh733J1__1v1TK08LvXy4DwtiLs6Ar5K0vxSFgOKfRB6MAcg3AJZTndr84rdKdntOaU3rWfJh-HaGBVAsDZLgXCKNkS0rUhqNACPKOyqc3heieafYUVFODo0\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\">\n        Khi-khi-kho̍k-kho̍k ê tshâ-kia̍h<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>sī bāng-tiong a-má ê siàu-liām<br />Lâng-kuân-hàn-tuā ê i<br />Sè-hàn-sî senn-tsò sè-lia̍p-tsí<br />M̄-koh tiānn-tiānn hōo sī-tuā-lâng iang-kah<br /><br />The̍h pún-tann, kā tsia-ê kué-tsí tann-khì bē<br /><br />Hioh-khùn--tsi̍t-ē, tshī sió-muē tsia̍h ping-kî-lîm<br />1 tshuì suà 1 tshuì<br /><br />M̄ bat tshoo-luân ê tsu-bī<br />Kah ang-sài tshuā 1 tuā tīn gín-á<br /><br />Pn̄g-kheh-á lāi-bīn ū i<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tuì bī-lâi ê ǹg-bāng<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tsù-sim ê khuànn-kòo<br /><br />Thang-á-mn̂g-guā<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>ū 1 tsâng tshiū hio̍h-á ōm koh tuā<br />Tshin-tshiūnn i kiânn-kuè <br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>hái-sua-poo-tíng ê kha-jiah<br />Tī hong-tiong kan-na tshun<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>si-si-su̍t-su̍t ê kha-pôo<br />Hōo lâng siàu-liām, hi-bî ê liû-luân\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiTTu-D2GM9ys1ukLuH8l57x4Jre3U2KWvSfqI_LeCLvvkZn1AOJRe2vXW7HQG3F9iOlHmaBmfk6ABhcgWLxtjYOZ5Sk-5WZivj1Oz-CJCHft3RCzDp6JMsHNkaEUca2LAMUob9tZQjHIEpJzESKcC-eXb6Ru4yqgQGrkzAC0r5LikyR-1zgp7O8T6zpcd7\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 386期，2026年05月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
